{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Python 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Python 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport bisect\nimport array\nn,m=list(map(int,input().split()))\na=array.array('L')\na.extend(map(int,input().split()))\na1,a2=array.array('L'),array.array('L')\nn1=n//2\n\ndef sums1(i,sum=0):\n    if i==n1:\n        a1.append(sum)\n    else:\n        sums1(i+1,(sum+a[i])%m)\n        sums1(i+1,sum)\n        \ndef sums2(i,sum=0):\n    if i==n:\n        a2.append(sum)\n    else:\n        sums2(i+1,(sum+a[i])%m)\n        sums2(i+1,sum)\n\nsums1(0)\nsums2(n1)\n\nans=0\nend=len(a2)-1\n\na1=array.array('L',sorted(set(a1)))\n\nfor i in a2:\n    j=bisect.bisect_left(a1,m-i)\n    if ans<a1[j-1]+i:\n        ans=a1[j-1]+i\nprint(ans)\n\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        String[] firstLine = br.readLine().split(\" \");\n        int n = Integer.parseInt(firstLine[0]);\n        int m = Integer.parseInt(firstLine[1]);\n        \n        String[] secondLine = br.readLine().split(\" \");\n        long[] a = new long[n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            a[i] = Long.parseLong(secondLine[i]);\n        }\n        \n        List<Long> a1 = new ArrayList<>();\n        List<Long> a2 = new ArrayList<>();\n        int n1 = n / 2;\n        \n        // Generate all subset sums for first half\n        generateSums(a, 0, n1, 0, m, a1);\n        \n        // Generate all subset sums for second half\n        generateSums(a, n1, n, 0, m, a2);\n        \n        // Sort and remove duplicates from a1\n        Collections.sort(a1);\n        List<Long> uniqueA1 = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (int i = 0; i < a1.size(); i++) {\n            if (i == 0 || !a1.get(i).equals(a1.get(i - 1))) {\n                uniqueA1.add(a1.get(i));\n            }\n        }\n        \n        long ans = 0;\n        for (long val : a2) {\n            long target = m - val;\n            int idx = binarySearchFirstGreaterOrEqual(uniqueA1, target);\n            if (idx > 0) {\n                long currentSum = uniqueA1.get(idx - 1) + val;\n                if (currentSum > ans) {\n                    ans = currentSum;\n                }\n            } else if (idx == 0 && !uniqueA1.isEmpty()) {\n                long currentSum = uniqueA1.get(0) + val;\n                if (currentSum > ans) {\n                    ans = currentSum;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n    \n    private static void generateSums(long[] a, int start, int end, long currentSum, int m, List<Long> result) {\n        if (start == end) {\n            result.add(currentSum % m);\n        } else {\n            generateSums(a, start + 1, end, (currentSum + a[start]) % m, m, result);\n            generateSums(a, start + 1, end, currentSum, m, result);\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private static int binarySearchFirstGreaterOrEqual(List<Long> list, long target) {\n        int left = 0;\n        int right = list.size();\n        while (left < right) {\n            int mid = (left + right) / 2;\n            if (list.get(mid) >= target) {\n                right = mid;\n            } else {\n                left = mid + 1;\n            }\n        }\n        return left;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00012659224739763886, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.95898348162882e-05, -1.4066597032069694e-05, -0.06993856281042099, -0.4746948480606079, -0.004647999536246061, -2.2172682292875834e-05, -0.0001299296854995191, -0.0006011109799146652, -5.352353764465079e-05, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -5.6503606174374e-05, -0.014168032445013523, -0.0008075552177615464, -0.1826772689819336, -4.6491513785440475e-06, -0.00014757021563127637, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -2.861018856492592e-06, -1.680836794548668e-05, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.020577985793352127, -0.016067780554294586, -3.576278118089249e-07, -3.2186455882765586e-06, -0.00032276666024699807, -0.00031144535751082003, -3.099436753473128e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -5.483612312673358e-06, -4.0531076592742465e-06, -2.2649508537142538e-05, -9.65590606938349e-06, -3.099436753473128e-06, -2.2411095415009186e-05, -5.483612312673358e-06, -0.004140495788305998, -1.311301275563892e-06, -0.6175403594970703, -4.23184028477408e-05, 0.0, -2.264974000354414e-06, -1.2278481335670222e-05, 0.0, -0.00012146688823122531, -0.00033849707688204944, -0.0001081169830285944, -1.9311717551317997e-05, -6.556489552167477e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -1.645074735279195e-05, 0.0, -1.847726889536716e-05, -9.536738616588991e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -7.152555099310121e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -1.0728830375228426e-06, 0.0, -5.602820692729438e-06, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, -3.528532761265524e-05, -7.0333